 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SUMMER_CIV5_HEADING_1','We Were Never Gone'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SUMMER_CIV5_TEXT_1','We Were Never Gone. Intelligent cicada-like people sleep beneath the roots, preserving their memories in tree rings and amber. Their synchronized return fills the summer canopy with a chorus of discovery and creation. The first processed owner-turn is Dormancy turn 1. Phase changes occur after that turn''s economic collection, apply immediately to combat, and schedule city yields for the next economic payout. At Standard speed, owner-turns 1-13 are Dormancy, 14-17 Emergence, 18-30 Dormancy, and 31-34 Emergence. Quick: 9/3; Standard: 13/4; Epic: 20/6; Marathon: 39/12 (Dormancy/Emergence).'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SUMMER_CIV5_HEADING_2','The Great Emergence'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SUMMER_CIV5_TEXT_2','Repeat Dormancy (+1 [ICON_FOOD] Food per city) and Emergence (+2 [ICON_PRODUCTION] Production and +1 [ICON_CULTURE] Culture per city). The first processed owner-turn is Dormancy turn 1. Phase changes occur after that turn''s economic collection, apply immediately to combat, and schedule city yields for the next economic payout. At Standard speed, owner-turns 1-13 are Dormancy, 14-17 Emergence, 18-30 Dormancy, and 31-34 Emergence. Quick: 9/3; Standard: 13/4; Epic: 20/6; Marathon: 39/12 (Dormancy/Emergence).'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SUMMER_CIV5_FACTOID_HEADING','Seventeen Summers'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SUMMER_CIV5_FACTOID_TEXT','The Standard cycle lasts seventeen owner-turns.'),
